---
import KodexOrganism from "../../../components/kodex/organism/KodexOrganism.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <title>KODEX−∞ Organism Engine Lab</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="lab">
      <header class="lab__header">
        <p>KODEX−∞ // INTERNAL LAB</p>
        <h1>UNIVERSAL ORGANISM ENGINE</h1>
        <p>
          Adapter conformance test: one image-driven FIELD and one procedural VORTEX mounted through
          the same lifecycle, input, quality, fallback and telemetry contract.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="lab__catalog">
        <section class="lab__stage" aria-labelledby="field-title">
          <div class="lab__metadata">
            <span>FAMILY: FIELD</span>
            <span>MODE: IMAGE_FIELD</span>
            <span>STATUS: EXPERIMENTAL</span>
          </div>
          <h2 id="field-title">THRESHOLD PORTAL ADAPTER</h2>
          <KodexOrganism
            preset="threshold-portal"
            fallback="/img/kodex/works/mandala-0cin-negativo.png"
            label="THRESHOLD · portal vivo sobre la obra"
            description="A radial recursive field generated from an authored KODEX source image. Activate with click, tap, Enter or Space."
            eager={true}
          />
        </section>

        <section class="lab__stage" aria-labelledby="vortex-title">
          <div class="lab__metadata lab__metadata--violet">
            <span>FAMILY: VORTEX</span>
            <span>MODE: SHADER</span>
            <span>STATUS: PROTOTYPE</span>
          </div>
          <h2 id="vortex-title">SIGNAL VORTEX ADAPTER</h2>
          <KodexOrganism
            preset="signal-vortex"
            fallback="/img/kodex/organisms/signal-vortex-fallback.svg"
            label="SIGNAL VORTEX · rotating convergence field"
            description="A procedural spiral field organized around a movable attractor. Activate to increase convergence."
          />
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="lab__notes">
        <h2>QA</h2>
        <ol>
          <li>Move the pointer to test normalized input in both adapters.</li>
          <li>Activate with click, tap, Enter or Space.</li>
          <li>Scroll between stages and verify only the visible WebGL organism runs.</li>
          <li>Enable reduced motion in the operating system and reload.</li>
          <li>Inspect <code>window.__kdxOrganisms.list()</code>.</li>
          <li>Background the tab and verify every render loop stops.</li>
          <li>Disable WebGL2 and verify each static fallback remains usable.</li>
        </ol>
      </aside>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { color-scheme: dark; background: #050505; }
  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgb(255 255 255 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
      #050505;
    background-size: 24px 24px;
    color: #e8e3da;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
  }

  .lab {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(16rem, 24rem);
    gap: 1rem;
    width: min(100%, 96rem);
    min-height: 100dvh;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__header,
  .lab__stage,
  .lab__notes {
    border: 1px solid rgb(232 227 218 / 0.35);
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.72);
  }

  .lab__header {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__header p,
  .lab__notes,
  .lab__metadata {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p { margin-block: 0 0.75rem; }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 0.9;
    letter-spacing: -0.06em;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .lab__catalog {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .lab__stage {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__metadata {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: #ff5656;
  }

  .lab__metadata--violet { color: #a76cff; }

  .lab__stage :global(.kdx-organism) {
    min-height: min(68vh, 48rem);
  }

  .lab__notes {
    position: sticky;
    top: 1rem;
    align-self: start;
    padding: 1rem;
  }

  .lab__notes ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lab__notes li + li { margin-top: 0.65rem; }
  code { color: #ff7777; }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .lab { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lab__header { grid-column: auto; }
    .lab__stage :global(.kdx-organism) { min-height: 55vh; }
    .lab__notes { position: static; }
  }
</style>
